IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tcta-types`
IMPORT `tcta-rules`

-- Taxation (Cross-border Trade) Act 2018 (UK) — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Import case` HAS
    `the goods`                                         IS A `Goods facts`
    `the persons`                                       IS A LIST OF `Person`
    `the duty`                                          IS A `Duty facts`

DECLARE `Import position` HAS
    `liabilities`                                       IS A LIST OF `Liability`
    `persons liable`                                    IS A LIST OF STRING
    `import duty at the applicable rate`                IS A NUMBER
    `last day to notify the first liability`            IS A MAYBE DATE
    `first liability enforceable`                       IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN

GIVEN ls IS A LIST OF `Liability`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Liability`
`the first of` ls MEANS
    CONSIDER ls
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN l FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST l

@ref ss 2-7, 16, Sch 6
@export default The position under Part 1 of the Taxation (Cross-border Trade) Act 2018 (UK) for imported goods: the liabilities to import duty and when they arise (ss 2-5), the persons jointly and severally liable (s 6), the ad valorem duty at the applicable rate (ss 7, 16), and for the first liability the last day for HMRC to notify it and whether it is enforceable (Sch 6 paras 1, 4). DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS AN `Import case`  @desc The goods and procedure, the persons involved, and the duty facts
GIVETH AN `Import position`
`the import position for` c MEANS
    `Import position` WITH
        `liabilities`                                   IS ls
        `persons liable`                                IS `the persons liable for` (c's `the goods`) `among` (c's `the persons`)
        `import duty at the applicable rate`            IS IF ls EQUALS EMPTY THEN 0 ELSE `the import duty for` (c's `the duty`)
        `last day to notify the first liability`        IS
            CONSIDER `the first of` ls
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST l  THEN JUST (`the last day to notify a liability incurred on` (l's `incurred on`) `with` (c's `the duty`))
        `first liability enforceable`                   IS
            CONSIDER `the first of` ls
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST l  THEN JUST (`a liability incurred on` (l's `incurred on`) `is enforceable with` (c's `the duty`))
    WHERE
        ls MEANS `the import duty liabilities for` (c's `the goods`)
